 149+ 31B4              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
 150+ 31B4              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
 151+ 31B4              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
 152+ 31B4              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
 153+ 31B4              ; carry set/A=status. Production DMA destination is physical 108000h on
 154+ 31B4              ; page 42h, mapped into WIN3 through MPAGEX (#10) using Project125 selector encoding.
 155+ 31B4              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 156+ 31B4              P126_NGS_DMA_MOD      EQU #1B
 157+ 31B4              P126_NGS_DMA_HAD      EQU #1C
 158+ 31B4              P126_NGS_DMA_MAD      EQU #1D
