 163+ 31B4              P126_NGS_MPAGEX_PORT  EQU #10
 164+ 31B4              ; Production DMA staging allocation: physical page 42h = 108000h.
 165+ 31B4              ; WIN3 (C000h-FFFFh) is the dedicated bank window; resident code/data/stack
